{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobAaco4b.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近人生初のMyカメラを買った"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46四期生の勝又春です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6/14(日)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オンラインミーグリありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single初のミーグリ🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この前ぶりの方も、\n久しぶりの方も、\nはじめましての方も、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お話しできて嬉しかったです☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生LIVEの感想も聞かせていただけて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「心から楽しかったよ！」\n「本当に行ってよかった！」\n「この曲のこの表情が良かった」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんな言葉をたくさんいただけて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて9人揃って、2日間ライブをお届けできてよかったなと思いました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また次回のミーグリでも、\nみなさんとお会いできるのを楽しみにしています🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに\nリアルミーグリは、幕張も京都も浴衣を着ようと思っていて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何色にしようか考え中です...！🎆"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どういう系がいいかな〜💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして\nカメラで初めて一緒に撮ったのは、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobDhT2i9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひいろさん！\n少し髪が短くなったひいろ！幼い感じでめちゃ可愛い💓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "上達して、同期や先輩方の写真も撮りたいな〜📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カメラに詳しい方、ぜひ教えてください🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "短いけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/moboioMD4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob7WvKb7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobYXLcBq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又 春　#39    サンキューだ😳"}], "source": "official"}